<title>CANADA: Kingsway Financial in share issue.</title>
<headline>Kingsway Financial in share issue.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kingsway Financial Services Inc said on Wednesday it agreed to issue about C$30 million worth of its common shares.</p>
<p>Its largest shareholder, Intercargo Corp, will sell C$6 million in a secondary offering.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds of this issue were slated to increase the regulatory capital for certain of Kingsway's insurance businesses, for working capital and for strategic acquisitions.</p>
<p>The offering will be underwritten by a syndicate led by First Marathon Securities Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
